  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "prologue",
      "title": "Prologue",
      "canonicalSlug": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "titleblock-div-0",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-title-block\">\n    <h1>A TELEPHONIC CONVERSATION</h1>\n    <h2>BY MARK TWAIN</h2>\n  </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-1",
          "text": "I consider that a conversation by telephone&mdash;when you are simply sitting\n    by and not taking any part in that conversation&mdash;is one of the solemnest\n    curiosities of this modern life. Yesterday I was writing a deep article on a\n    sublime philosophical subject while such a conversation was going on in the\n    room. I notice that one can always write best when somebody is talking\n    through a telephone close by. Well, the thing began in this way. A member\n    of our household came in and asked me to have our house put into\n    communication with Mr. Bagley's, down town. I have observed, in many cities,\n    that the sex always shrink from calling up the central office themselves. I\n    don't know why, but they do. So I touched the bell, and this talk ensued:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-2",
          "text": "<i>Central Office. (Gruffly.)</i> Hello!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-3",
          "text": "I. Is it the Central Office?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-4",
          "text": "C. O. Of course it is. What do you want?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-5",
          "text": "I. Will you switch me on to the Bagleys, please?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-6",
          "text": "C. O. All right. Just keep your ear to the telephone."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-7",
          "text": "Then I heard <i>k-look, k-look, k'look&mdash;klook-klook-klook-look-look!</i>\n    then a horrible &ldquo;gritting&rdquo; of teeth, and finally a piping female voice:\n    Y-e-s? (<i>Rising inflection.</i>) Did you wish to speak to me?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-8",
          "text": "Without answering, I handed the telephone to the applicant, and sat down.\n    Then followed that queerest of all the queer things in this world&mdash;a\n    conversation with only one end to it. You hear questions asked; you don't\n    hear the answer. You hear invitations given; you hear no thanks in return.\n    You have listening pauses of dead silence, followed by apparently\n    irrelevant and unjustifiable exclamations of glad surprise or sorrow or\n    dismay. You can't make head or tail of the talk, because you never hear\n    anything that the person at the other end of the wire says. Well, I heard\n    the following remarkable series of observations, all from the one tongue,\n    and all shouted&mdash;for you can't ever persuade the sex to speak gently\n    into a telephone:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-9",
          "text": "Yes? Why, how did <i>that </i>happen?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-10",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-11",
          "text": "What did you say?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-12",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-13",
          "text": "Oh no, I don't think it was."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-14",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-15",
          "text": "<i> No</i>! Oh no, I didn't mean <i>that</i>. I meant, put it in while it\n    is still boiling&mdash;or just before it <i>comes </i>to a boil."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-16",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-17",
          "text": "<i>What</i>?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-18",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-19",
          "text": "I turned it over with a backstitch on the selvage edge."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-20",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-21",
          "text": "Yes, I like that way, too; but I think it's better to baste it on with\n    Valenciennes or bombazine, or something of that sort. It gives it such an\n    air&mdash;and attracts so much notice."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-22",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-23",
          "text": "It's forty-ninth Deuteronomy, sixty-fourth to ninety-seventh inclusive. I\n    think we ought all to read it often."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-24",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-25",
          "text": "Perhaps so; I generally use a hair pin."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-26",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-27",
          "text": "What did you say? (<i>Aside</i>.) Children, do be quiet!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-28",
          "text": "Pause"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-29",
          "text": "<i>Oh!</i> B <i>flat!</i> Dear me, I thought you said it was the cat!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-30",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-31",
          "text": "Since <i>when</i>?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-32",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-33",
          "text": "Why, <i>I</i> never heard of it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-34",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-35",
          "text": "You astound me! It seems utterly impossible!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-36",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-37",
          "text": "<i>Who </i>did?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-38",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-39",
          "text": "Good-ness gracious!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-40",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-41",
          "text": "Well, what<i> is</i> this world coming to? Was it right in <i>church</i>?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-42",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-43",
          "text": "And was her <i>mother </i>there?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-44",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-45",
          "text": "Why, Mrs. Bagley, I should have died of humiliation! What did they<i> do</i>?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-46",
          "text": "Long pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-47",
          "text": "I can't be perfectly sure, because I haven't the notes by me; but I think\n    it goes something like this: te-rolly-loll-loll, loll lolly-loll-loll, O\n    tolly-loll-loll-<i>lee-ly-li</i>-i-do! And then <i>repeat</i>, you know."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-48",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-49",
          "text": "Yes, I think it<i> is</i> very sweet&mdash;and very solemn and impressive,\n    if you get the andantino and the pianissimo right."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-50",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-51",
          "text": "Oh, gum-drops, gum-drops! But I never allow them to eat striped candy. And\n    of course they <i>can't</i>, till they get their teeth, anyway."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-52",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-53",
          "text": "<i>What</i>?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-54",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-55",
          "text": "Oh, not in the least&mdash;go right on. He's here writing&mdash;it doesn't\n    bother <i>him</i>."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-56",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-57",
          "text": "Very well, I'll come if I can. (<i>Aside</i>.) Dear me, how it does tire a\n    person's arm to hold this thing up so long! I wish she'd&mdash;"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-58",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-59",
          "text": "Oh no, not at all; I <i>like </i>to talk&mdash;but I'm afraid I'm keeping\n    you from your affairs."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-60",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-61",
          "text": "Visitors?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-62",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-63",
          "text": "No, we never use butter on them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-64",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-65",
          "text": "Yes, that is a very good way; but all the cook-books say they are very\n    unhealthy when they are out of season. And<i> he</i> doesn't like them,\n    anyway&mdash;especially canned."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-66",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-67",
          "text": "Oh, I think that is too high for them; we have never paid over fifty cents\n    a bunch."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-68",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-69",
          "text": "Must you go? Well, <i>Good</i>-by."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-70",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-71",
          "text": "Yes, I think so. <i>Good</i>-by."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-72",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-73",
          "text": "Four o'clock, then&mdash;I'll be ready. <i>Good</i>-by."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-74",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-75",
          "text": "Thank you ever so much. <i>Good</i>-by."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-76",
          "text": "Pause."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-77",
          "text": "Oh, not at all!&mdash;just as fresh&mdash;<i>which</i>? Oh, I'm glad to\n    hear you say that. <i>Good</i>-by."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-78",
          "text": "(Hangs up the telephone and says, &ldquo;Oh, it <i>does </i>tire a person's arm\n    so!&rdquo;)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "id": "prologue-p-79",
          "text": "A man delivers a single brutal &ldquo;Good-by,&rdquo; and that is the end of it. Not\n    so with the gentle sex&mdash;I say it in their praise; they cannot abide\n    abruptness."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}